# Where Pulse points people, read by scripts/bundle.sh and scripts/release.sh.
# bundle.sh stamps each value that is set on the bundle's copy of Info.plist;
# the source plist never carries them. Shell syntax: the scripts source this
# file.
#
# These are About's links. Pulse falls back to placeholders on pulse.example
# for the ones left empty. Support is an email address, a help page such as
# the issue tracker, or both; one is enough, and with no address About's
# Support link shows SUPPORT_URL's host. scripts/release.sh refuses a release
# until WEBSITE_URL, PRIVACY_POLICY_URL, EULA_URL, and SUPPORT_EMAIL or
# SUPPORT_URL are set. Pulse never opens these itself: only when someone
# clicks one.
WEBSITE_URL=https://lineapps.vercel.app/pulse/
SUPPORT_URL=https://github.com/millerroberts180/pulse/issues
SUPPORT_EMAIL=
PRIVACY_POLICY_URL=https://github.com/millerroberts180/pulse/blob/main/docs/legal/privacy-policy.md
EULA_URL=https://github.com/millerroberts180/pulse/blob/main/docs/legal/EULA.txt
